## Reset checklist

When Sprint 0 ends or Sequential lock completes:

1. Copy durable facts to `AGENT_MEMORY.md` / `DECISION_LOG.md` if they survived the phase
2. Replace `scratchpad.md` with a fresh copy of this example
3. Stop re-reading `docs/INITIALIZATION_PROMPT.md` as the daily driver; use `/feature` for Sprint 2+
